OL,3,AMushroom murderer trial undermined by
OL,4,A'catastrophic' hotel mix-up, appeal
OL,5,Acourt told
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer lawyers also argued some evidence
OL,8,Fin the trial was too speculative, while
OL,9,Fevidence crucial to their own case was
OL,10,Fwrongfully excluded.
OL,12,FAt the same hearing, Victoria's
OL,13,FDirector of Public Prosecutions is
OL,14,Fappealing against the sentence, arguing
OL,15,Fa 33-year parole period is "manifestly
OL,16,Finadequate".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
